"new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KAWAHARA HIROKAZU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SONY CORP</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAWAHARA, HIROKAZU</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SONY CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KAWAHARA HIROKAZU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAWAHARA, HIROKAZU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A program supplied from a personal computer through an interface (31) is processed according to a program stored in a ROM (36), developed in a RAM (33), and executed by a CPU (32). The data generated by the execution is stored in a nonvolatile memory (34). The interface (31), the CPU (32), the RAM (33), nonvolatile memory (34), and the ROM (36) are contained in an adapter (26) integrally constituted as a semiconductor IC.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne le traitement d'un programme fourni par un ordinateur individuel par le biais d'une interface (31) en fonction d'un programme mémorisé dans une mémoire morte (36), développé dans une mémoire vive (33) et exécuté par une unité centrale (32). Les données générées pendant l'exécution sont mémorisées dans une mémoire rémanente (34). L'interface (31), l'unité centrale (32), la mémoire vive (33), la mémoire rémanente (34) et la mémoire morte (36) se trouvent dans un adaptateur (26) intégralement formé comme un circuit intégré à semi-conducteur.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>